{%- comment -%}
  Nessclusive homepage.

  A .liquid template with static {% section %} tags, deliberately NOT
  templates/index.json. A JSON template lets the merchant reorder, remove, and
  duplicate sections in the customizer — someone could drop the hero or push
  the FAQ above the fold. Static sections still expose every setting for
  editing, but the running order is fixed here in code.

  That is the mechanism behind the Editability policy. See PLAN.md, Decision #12.

  Order matches the updated prototype (lines 86-720). Note that booking and
  about now come before Explore Collection, and the hero's quick links scroll
  to #services, #book, and #about.
{%- endcomment -%}

